# Hifonix — product CMS (Supabase). Public, browser-safe values only.
# Copy to .env.local (local dev) and add the same two variables in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables.
# Leave empty to run the bundled sample catalogue (the CMS page then shows setup steps).
#
#   Supabase dashboard → Project Settings → API:
#     VITE_SUPABASE_URL       = Project URL (https://xxxx.supabase.co)
#     VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY  = anon / public key
#
# The anon key is designed to be public: row-level security (supabase/schema.sql) lets visitors read
# published products only, and only signed-in admins can write. NEVER put the service_role key or any
# other secret in a VITE_ variable — VITE_ values are compiled into the public site.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
